          Antarctica:  it's your butt on the line, so you'd best check every detail of
          that transportation vehicle you'll be trusting your life to.
    - Letting the AI write the code
        - If you're going to let the AI do all the coding, your job as the compass is to
          spend particular care crafting the test cases and the design specs.  This is
          your lodestone in the messy development path.  In fact, careful test cases are
